{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"上水警署男警疑吞槍 當場死亡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1878e9108a6baca43c0e30cb14d8a69/2026-11/20261126_news_gun_si.png\"/><p>上水警署有警員吞槍死亡。今日（26日）早上10時54分，一名男警員在上水警署內使用佩槍自轟。救護員到場，經檢驗證實男警當場死亡。</p><p>現場消息稱，死者隸屬交通部，事發於洗手間內。警方正調查事件。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n<p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:21:08.237627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:32.941525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:32.941525+00:00","content_hash":"61e22195434c975f5810bfbc22e0f527faf79b4e38c3ee9a21b3ae5d801b19c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}